id: pm-vcs-l8jv
title: Documented TOON record paths fail staging because the record codec accepts JSON only
description: "The README's primary init example configures .agents/pm/**/*.toon as first-class records, but staging a real pm-initialized tracker calls the JSON-only record decoder and aborts with record payload is not valid JSON. This prevents pm-vcs from using pm's native item format as the structured merge primitive it advertises."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 0
tags[5]: "format:toon",pm-sdk,real-data,records,release-blocker
created_at: "2026-08-01T03:59:00.345Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-01T06:38:22.457Z"
author: codex
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: A real installed-CLI test stages native TOON item and history data through the registered extension; canonical TOON decoding and encoding preserve all supported pm fields; per-field merge handles concurrent PM item edits; JSON record paths remain compatible; README examples are executable.
parent: pm-vcs-tr2a
severity: high
repro_steps: Initialize a fresh pm workspace; install pm-vcs; run pm vcs init with record path .agents/pm/**/*.toon; create a Task with pm; run pm vcs add.
expected_result: Native PM TOON items stage as record objects and later merge per field without losing TOON semantics or history.
actual_result: pm vcs add aborts with Record payload is not valid JSON.
affected_version: 2026.7.30
component: engine/records
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-01T04:44:55.760Z",codex,Cubic correctly identified that the native TOON failure is described as a release blocker but was not machine-tagged as one. Priority and tags now match the release boundary; no publishing is permitted until its installed-CLI acceptance passes.
  "2026-08-01T06:38:22.439Z",codex,"CodeRabbit correctly separated this blocker from release:check. npm run accept:native-toon initializes a disposable real PM tracker, installs this checkout through the installed pm CLI, configures the documented TOON record path, creates a real Task, and runs pm vcs add. It currently fails at the expected JSON-only record decoder and always removes the temporary project."
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
  engine/model.ts,project,record codec boundary
  README.md,project,documented TOON example
  scripts/accept-native-toon.ts,project,disposable installed-CLI reproduction independent of the history audit
tests[2]:
  - command: "npm run accept:native-toon"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 300
    note: disposable installed-CLI native TOON staging acceptance; fails closed until the record codec supports TOON
  - command: "npm run release:check"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 2400
body: ""
